From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:10:06 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] build(release): add raft release publication hooks

Adds the producer-side hooks the immutable release pipeline needs: every
published module applies gradle/raft-artifacts-publishing.gradle.kts, which
stages publications into a caller-supplied file repository (no credentials)
and stamps POMs with the source SHA. In publication mode mavenLocal and the
upstream maven repos are skipped; the OHOS settings resolve KBA plugins and
Raft-hosted predecessors, and -PkuiklyOhosOnly=true limits the OHOS build to
ohosArm64 (upstream 2.28 runtimeLegacy/js/android source-set wiring moved
inside that gate). Also locks Pods for --deployment installs.

Fork-Patch: build-raft-release-publication-hooks
Origin: 7b8541b2 fa499ac3 1a26a84f
Upstream-Status: not-upstreamable
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>
---
